    <string name="home_limits_title">What this does and does not cover</string>
    <string name="home_limits_body">Muto filters DNS, so it stops ads and trackers that live on their own domains — most in-app advertising, and most of what you would otherwise see in Chrome. It cannot remove the ads YouTube and Twitch stitch into the video itself, because those arrive from the same servers as the video. See the documentation for what does work there.</string>

